> Any ideas or pointers would be helpful.

I'm trying to work out the risk/benefit profile
of starting to read spellbooks pretty early,
like around the time you finish both Sokoban
and Minetown.  On the one hand, you risk
losing the books and possibly suffering
other negative effects.  On the other hand,
Monks are supposed to be spell casters,
and the one spell you start with is only so
much help (although, if it's healing, it can
definitely save your bacon a few times).
Knowing some more spells might help
quite a bit.  So I'm trying to get a feel for
the dynamics of this and decide how long
to wait and, particularly, what chance of
success to settle for when reading books
as a monk.


